  "interpretationLimits": [
    "The original positiveFlameCentres label counts diagnostic F>.001 centres, not all positive scalar values. Warm statistics are F-weighted over that subset. No cutoff, filtering or data edit was applied to runtime fields.",
    "Gradient energy means a sum of squared analytic trilinear gradient components at cell midpoints where max(corners)>.001; it is not physical fluid energy or proof of useful visible flame sheets.",
    "T is an uncalibrated solver proxy. No inspected F>.001 centre reaches T>=3; this is not a claim about every nonreacting grid location.",
    "Canonical tick1 ignition at1/60s gives the idealized recorded source ages; analyses use exact half blends at inspected native ticks. GPU float timing/interpolation is not reproduced bit-for-bit.",
    "Nine specified floor-anchored paths per view use5mm CPU-double quadrature and lowerA/taper. They omit native opaque depth/player legibility/GLSLband stepping/color/LDR composition; calculated opacity is not a rendered pixel.",
    "No image editing, offscreen picture, appearance acceptance, performance result or implementer quality score is supplied."
  ]
